  {
    "htmlValue": "<h2><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Tokens &amp; specs</span></h2>"
  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<p>Use the table's menu to select a token set. Split button token sets are organized by size. <a href=\"/m3/pages/design-tokens/overview/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn about design tokens</a></p>"
  },
